      </div>
      <div class="card p-6 md:p-8">
        <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">The district source supports the place identity, temple tradition and nearby beach topics. Maps ratings and listed hours were checked on 22 October 2026 and may change. Current facility operation, fees and swimming safety are not established here.</p>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm font-bold text-ocean-700">
          <li><a class="underline" href={sourceLinks.district} rel="noreferrer">Uttara Kannada district — Gokarna tourism information</a></li>
          <li><a class="underline" href={sourceLinks.stateTourism} rel="noreferrer">Karnataka Tourism — Gokarna (checked 22 October 2026)</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-500">Note: this site does not replace official publications. Weather, sea state, transport timings, entry rules and facility status can change on the day of travel.</p>
